    "averageRating": 0,
    "category": "Finance",
    "createdAt": 1793297962,
    "description": "The payments displayed in this dataset exclude direct payments to State employees for salaries, benefits, and, prior to May 2013, employee reimbursement expenses. The dataset also excludes payments that are confidential under applicable state or federal laws, regulations, or policies, as well as payments for which disclosure could compromise the confidentiality of recipients, such as certain direct benefit payments. Approximately one percent of all non-employee payments are excluded under these criteria.\n\nPayment information is derived from the State of Vermont's VISION statewide financial management system. State agencies and departments are responsible for entering and maintaining their financial transactions within VISION. Although VISION serves as the State's primary financial system, certain financial activities may be managed through other authorized systems and therefore may not be reflected in this dataset.\n\nThe information provided is intended solely for informational and transparency purposes. It does not constitute legal, financial, investment, accounting, or other professional advice and should not be relied upon as such. While reasonable efforts are made to ensure the accuracy and completeness of the information presented, the State of Vermont makes no representations or warranties regarding its accuracy, reliability, or completeness and assumes no liability for any errors, omissions, or decisions made based on the information contained herein.",
